<span class="line">            变量名称v <span class="token operator">=</span> 比较用 <span class="token keyword">if</span> 比较用 <span class="token operator">&gt;</span> 输出<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token operator">-</span><span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span> <span class="token keyword">else</span> 输出<span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token operator">-</span><span class="token number">1</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span></span>
